      "intent": "conversation",
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'd be happy to help you build an ISP WiFi billing system! This is a comprehensive project that requires careful planning.\n\nTo get started effectively, I need to understand your requirements better:\n\n## Key Questions:\n\n**Project Scope:**\n1. Are you starting from scratch, or do you have existing code you want me to help with?\n2. What's your target timeline and MVP (minimum viable product)?\n\n**Technical Stack:**\n3. What programming language/framework do you prefer? (e.g., Python/Django, Node.js, PHP Laravel, Java Spring, etc.)\n4. Do you have a preference for the database? (PostgreSQL, MySQL, etc.)\n\n**Feature Priorities:**\n5. Which features are most critical for your MVP?\n   - PPPoE account management\n   - Hotspot account management\n   - Mobile money integration (which providers? M-Pesa, Airtel Money, etc.?)\n   - Banking integration\n   - Usage billing/metering\n   - Customer portal\n   - Admin dashboard\n   - Reporting\n\n**Integration Details:**\n6. Which African mobile money platforms are you targeting? (M-Pesa, Airtel Money, Orange Money, MTN Mobile Money, etc.)\n7. For banking, which payment gateways? (Pesapal, Flutterwave, Paystack, etc.)\n\n**Architecture:**\n8. Do you need:\n   - A REST API backend?\n   - A web dashboard (admin & customer)?\n   - Mobile app integration?\n   - Real-time usage tracking?\n\nOnce you provide more details, I can help you:\n- Design the system architecture\n- Set up a GitHub repository with starter code\n- Create database schemas\n- Build API endpoints\n- Implement payment integrations\n- Set up CI/CD pipelines\n\nWhat would you like to focus on first?",
      "createdAt": "2026-05-19T23:42:03.425149172Z",
      "threadID": "4330bdab-653c-45ee-bbc5-4b6647884f5b",
