      "content": "````\n\r\nThis platform should support:\r\n\r\n* PPPoE subscriber management\r\n* Hotspot captive portal onboarding\r\n* Multi-ISP management\r\n* African payment integrations\r\n* White-label branding/themes\r\n* Agent/reseller systems\r\n* SMS/Email/WhatsApp notifications\r\n* MikroTik + Radius integration\r\n* Fiber/Wireless ISP operations\r\n* SaaS deployment model\r\n* Franchise / regional ISP control\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n# 1. Core System Architecture\r\n\r\n## Recommended Stack\r\n\r\n### Backend\r\n\r\n* Language: Node.js or Golang\r\n* API: REST + GraphQL\r\n* Framework:\r\n\r\n  * Node.js → NestJS\r\n  * Go → Fiber/Gin\r\n\r\n### Frontend\r\n\r\n* React + Next.js\r\n* TailwindCSS\r\n* Theme engine support\r\n* PWA mobile support\r\n\r\n### Database\r\n\r\n* PostgreSQL (main transactional DB)\r\n* Redis (sessions + queues)\r\n* ClickHouse (analytics/logs)\r\n\r\n### Authentication\r\n\r\n* JWT + Refresh Tokens\r\n* OAuth2\r\n* MFA (OTP/SMS/Auth App)\r\n\r\n### Radius & Network\r\n\r\n* FreeRADIUS\r\n* MikroTik API\r\n* DHCP integration\r\n* PPPoE concentrator support\r\n\r\n### Infrastructure\r\n\r\n* Docker\r\n* Kubernetes\r\n* NGINX\r\n* Cloudflare\r\n* MinIO/S3\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n# 2. Main Modules\r\n\r\n# A. Subscriber Management\r\n\r\nHandles:\r\n\r\n* Customer onboarding\r\n* KYC\r\n* Device registration\r\n* SIM/passport/NIN verification\r\n* Address/location\r\n* Package assignment\r\n\r\n## Customer Types\r\n\r\n* Home\r\n* SME\r\n* Enterprise\r\n* Public hotspot users\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n# B. PPPoE Management\r\n\r\n## Features\r\n\r\n* Create PPPoE accounts\r\n* Suspend/reactivate\r\n* Dynamic speed profiles\r\n* Quota management\r\n* MAC binding\r\n* Concurrent session control\r\n\r\n## Flow\r\n\r\n```text\r\nCustomer Created\r\n   ↓\r\nPackage Assigned\r\n   ↓\r\nRadius Generates Credentials\r\n   ↓\r\nMikroTik Sync\r\n   ↓\r\nPPPoE Login Active\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n# C. Hotspot Management\r\n\r\n## Captive Portal Features\r\n\r\n* Voucher login\r\n* Mobile money payment login\r\n* Social login\r\n* OTP login\r\n* QR code onboarding\r\n* WhatsApp onboarding\r\n\r\n## Authentication Methods\r\n\r\n* Username/password\r\n* Phone number OTP\r\n* Voucher codes\r\n* Payment auto-login\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n# D. Billing Engine\r\n\r\nThis is the heart of the system.\r\n\r\n## Billing Types\r\n\r\n### Recurring\r\n\r\n* Monthly\r\n* Weekly\r\n* Daily\r\n\r\n### Usage Based\r\n\r\n* GB consumed\r\n* Session time\r\n* Peak/off-peak\r\n\r\n### Hybrid\r\n\r\n* Monthly + overage\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n# E. African Payment Gateway Layer\r\n\r\nBuild a unified payment abstraction.\r\n\r\n## Mobile Money Integrations\r\n\r\n### East Africa\r\n\r\n* MTN MoMo\r\n* Airtel Money\r\n* M-Pesa\r\n* Tigo Pesa\r\n\r\n### West Africa\r\n\r\n* Orange Money\r\n* Wave\r\n* Moov\r\n\r\n### Southern Africa\r\n\r\n* EcoCash\r\n* Mukuru\r\n* Ozow\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Banking Integrations\r\n\r\n### Pan African\r\n\r\n* Flutterwave\r\n* Paystack\r\n* DPO\r\n* Cellulant\r\n\r\n### Direct Bank APIs\r\n\r\n* Stanbic\r\n* Equity\r\n* Absa\r\n* UBA\r\n* GTBank\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n# F. Multi-Currency Support\r\n\r\nSupport:\r\n\r\n* UGX\r\n* KES\r\n* TZS\r\n* RWF\r\n* NGN\r\n* GHS\r\n* ZAR\r\n* USD\r\n\r\nUse:\r\n\r\n```text\r\nExchange Service Layer\r\n```\r\n\r\nwith automatic FX updates.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n# 3. Multi-Tenant ISP Management\r\n\r\nThis allows you to manage MANY ISPs from one system.\r\n\r\n# Tenant Architecture\r\n\r\n```text\r\nPlatform Owner\r\n   ├── ISP A\r\n   ├── ISP B\r\n   ├── ISP C\r\n   └── Franchise Partners\r\n```\r\n\r\nEach ISP gets:\r\n\r\n* Own branding\r\n* Own portal\r\n* Own customers\r\n* Own routers\r\n* Own payment accounts\r\n* Own reports\r\n* Own domain/subdomain\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n# 4. Login & Access Management\r\n\r\n# User Types\r\n\r\n| Role            | Access                |\r\n| --------------- | --------------------- |\r\n| Super Admin     | Entire platform       |\r\n| ISP Owner       | Their ISP only        |\r\n| Finance Manager | Billing/payments      |\r\n| Network Admin   | Routers/radius        |\r\n| Agent           | Customer registration |\r\n| Support         | Tickets only          |\r\n| Customer        | Self-service portal   |\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n# Authentication Flow\r\n\r\n```text\r\nUser Login\r\n   ↓\r\nJWT Issued\r\n   ↓\r\nRole Permissions Loaded\r\n   ↓\r\nTenant Context Applied\r\n   ↓\r\nDashboard Opened\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n# 5. Theme & White-Label System\r\n\r\nEach ISP can customize:\r\n\r\n* Logo\r\n* Colors\r\n* Domain\r\n* Login page\r\n* SMS sender name\r\n* Captive portal design\r\n* Invoice design\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n# Theme Engine Design\r\n\r\n## Database\r\n\r\n```sql\r\nthemes\r\n- id\r\n- tenant_id\r\n- primary_color\r\n- secondary_color\r\n- logo_url\r\n- font_family\r\n- portal_layout\r\n- dark_mode\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n# Dynamic Theme Loading\r\n\r\nFrontend loads theme at login:\r\n\r\n```javascript\r\nGET /api/theme/current\r\n```\r\n\r\nApply:\r\n\r\n```css\r\n:root {\r\n  --primary: #0ea5e9;\r\n  --secondary: #111827;\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n# 6. ISP Management Dashboard\r\n\r\n# Main Dashboard\r\n\r\n## Widgets\r\n\r\n* Active users\r\n* Online PPPoE sessions\r\n* Hotspot sessions\r\n* Revenue today\r\n* Failed payments\r\n* Expiring subscriptions\r\n* Router status\r\n* Bandwidth usage\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n# ISP Operations Panel\r\n\r\nManage:\r\n\r\n* Routers\r\n* Towers\r\n* Packages\r\n* Zones\r\n* Staff\r\n* Agents\r\n* Revenue\r\n* Tickets\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n# 7. MikroTik Integration\r\n\r\n## Core Features\r\n\r\n* Auto sync packages\r\n* Queue management\r\n* PPP secrets sync\r\n* Hotspot user sync\r\n* NAS monitoring\r\n* Auto disconnect on expiry\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n# MikroTik Communication\r\n\r\nUse:\r\n\r\n* RouterOS API\r\n* SSH fallback\r\n* Radius CoA\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n# 8. Radius Architecture\r\n\r\n# Recommended\r\n\r\n## FreeRADIUS Cluster\r\n\r\n```text\r\nLoad Balancer\r\n   ├── Radius Node 1\r\n   ├── Radius Node 2\r\n   └── Radius Node 3\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n# Database Tables\r\n\r\n## radcheck\r\n\r\n```sql\r\nusername\r\nattribute\r\nop\r\nvalue\r\n```\r\n\r\n## radreply\r\n\r\n```sql\r\nusername\r\nattribute\r\nvalue\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n# 9. Customer Self-Service Portal\r\n\r\nCustomers can:\r\n\r\n* Pay bills\r\n* Upgrade package\r\n* View usage\r\n* Reset password\r\n* Download invoices\r\n* Buy hotspot time\r\n* Refer users\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n# 10. Notifications\r\n\r\n# Channels\r\n\r\n* SMS\r\n* WhatsApp\r\n* Email\r\n* Push notifications\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n# Examples\r\n\r\n## Payment Reminder\r\n\r\n```text\r\nYour internet subscription expires tomorrow.\r\nPay now to avoid disconnection.\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n# 11. Agent & Reseller System\r\n\r\nAgents can:\r\n\r\n* Register users\r\n* Sell vouchers\r\n* Receive commissions\r\n* Track earnings\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n# Commission Model\r\n\r\n```text\r\nSale → Commission Engine → Wallet Credit\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n# 12. Voucher System\r\n\r\nGenerate:\r\n\r\n* Scratch cards\r\n* QR vouchers\r\n* Time vouchers\r\n* Data vouchers\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n# 13. Scalability Design\r\n\r\n# Suggested Deployment\r\n\r\n## Core Services\r\n\r\n```text\r\nAPI Gateway\r\nAuth Service\r\nBilling Service\r\nRadius Service\r\nPayment Service\r\nNotification Service\r\nAnalytics Service\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n# Containerization\r\n\r\nUse:\r\n\r\n```text\r\nDocker + Kubernetes\r\n```\r\n\r\nfor easy upgrades.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n# 14. Upgradeability Strategy\r\n\r\n# Modular Architecture\r\n\r\nEvery module should be isolated:\r\n\r\n```text\r\npayments/\r\nbilling/\r\nradius/\r\ncrm/\r\nanalytics/\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis enables:\r\n\r\n* Easy updates\r\n* Independent scaling\r\n* Plugin support\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n# Plugin Marketplace (Future)\r\n\r\nISPs can install:\r\n\r\n* SMS providers\r\n* Payment gateways\r\n* CRM plugins\r\n* AI support bots\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n# 15. Recommended Folder Structure\r\n\r\n```text\r\n/apps\r\n   /admin-portal\r\n   /customer-portal\r\n   /agent-app\r\n\r\n/services\r\n   /auth-service\r\n   /billing-service\r\n   /payment-service\r\n   /radius-service\r\n   /notification-service\r\n\r\n/packages\r\n   /ui-kit\r\n   /shared\r\n   /sdk\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n# 16. Security\r\n\r\n# Must Have\r\n\r\n* MFA\r\n* IP restrictions\r\n* Device fingerprinting\r\n* Audit logs\r\n* Encryption at rest\r\n* PCI compliance\r\n* API rate limiting\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n# 17. Reporting & Analytics\r\n\r\n## Reports\r\n\r\n* Revenue\r\n* Churn\r\n* Active users\r\n* Tower utilization\r\n* Peak bandwidth\r\n* Payment success rates\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n# 18. Recommended Hosting\r\n\r\n## Africa Optimized\r\n\r\n### Primary\r\n\r\n* AWS Cape Town\r\n* Azure South Africa\r\n* Oracle Cloud Johannesburg\r\n\r\n### Edge\r\n\r\n* Cloudflare\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n# 19. Suggested SaaS Model\r\n\r\nYou can monetize by:\r\n\r\n| Model             | Revenue     |\r\n| ----------------- | ----------- |\r\n| Per subscriber    | Monthly fee |\r\n| Per ISP tenant    | License     |\r\n| Transaction fee   | Payments    |\r\n| White-label setup | One-time    |\r\n| SMS markup        | Usage       |\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n# 20. Suggested Tech Roadmap\r\n\r\n# Phase 1\r\n\r\n* Authentication\r\n* PPPoE\r\n* Hotspot\r\n* Billing\r\n* Payments\r\n\r\n# Phase 2\r\n\r\n* Mobile apps\r\n* AI analytics\r\n* CRM\r\n* Ticketing\r\n\r\n# Phase 3\r\n\r\n* Franchise management\r\n* Multi-country taxation\r\n* AI fraud detection\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n# Example Login System\r\n\r\n## Login API\r\n\r\n```http\r\nPOST /api/auth/login\r\n```\r\n\r\nRequest:\r\n\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"email\": \"admin@isp.com\",\r\n  \"password\": \"********\"\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nResponse:\r\n\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"token\": \"jwt_token\",\r\n  \"tenant\": \"ISP-UGANDA\",\r\n  \"role\": \"SUPER_ADMIN\"\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n# Example Theme Switching\r\n\r\n```http\r\nPUT /api/theme\r\n```\r\n\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"primaryColor\": \"#1d4ed8\",\r\n  \"darkMode\": true,\r\n  \"logo\": \"logo.png\"\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n# Example Multi-ISP Switching\r\n\r\nSuper Admin dashboard:\r\n\r\n```text\r\n[ Select ISP ▼ ]\r\n```\r\n\r\nSwitch tenant context dynamically:\r\n\r\n```javascript\r\nsetTenant(tenantId)\r\n```\r\n\r\nAll API calls become:\r\n\r\n```text\r\n/api/{tenantId}/customers\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n# Final Recommended Product Name Ideas\r\n\r\n* AfroNet OSS\r\n* RadiusAfrica\r\n* PanISP\r\n* UmojaNet\r\n* NetCore Africa\r\n* WiFiHub Africa\r\n* RadiusX\r\n* ISPFlow Africa\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n# Recommended Next Step\r\n\r\nBuild in this order:\r\n\r\n1. Authentication\r\n2. Multi-tenant engine\r\n3. Billing core\r\n4. Radius integration\r\n5. MikroTik sync\r\n6. Payment abstraction\r\n7. Customer portal\r\n8. Analytics\r\n9. Mobile apps\r\n10. White-label themes\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n# Best Overall Architecture\r\n\r\n```text\r\nFrontend (Next.js)\r\n        ↓\r\nAPI Gateway\r\n        ↓\r\nMicroservices\r\n        ↓\r\nPostgreSQL + Redis\r\n        ↓\r\nFreeRADIUS + MikroTik\r\n        ↓\r\nPayments + SMS APIs\r\n```\r\n\r\nI can also help you with:\r\n\r\n* Full database schema\r\n* MikroTik Radius configs\r\n* PPPoE setup scripts\r\n* Hotspot captive portal\r\n* SaaS multi-tenant architecture\r\n* Flutter mobile app\r\n* Docker deployment\r\n* Kubernetes setup\r\n* UI/UX dashboard design\r\n* Complete API documentation\r\n* Payment integrations for Africa\r\n* White-label reseller system\r\n* AI automation for ISPs\r\n* Full source code starter structure\n````\nIsp wifi billing system to handle ppoe and Hotspot accounts mobile money and banking around africa\nmake all the features editable from the main admins tab rewrite the code allowing that allow OLT hostin and able to link mutiple country's in one account create and app which can be accessed by email verification",
